  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk / Tax Collector | Chester, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Community Resources   \t\t\t \n     How do I   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Special Forms & Help Guides \r\n\t\t\t Boat Registration \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licensing \r\n\t\t\t Elections & Voting \r\n\t\t\t Fill & Dredge Permit \r\n\t\t\t Fines - Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Forms Library \r\n\t\t\t Genealogical Research \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t New Resident Information \r\n\t\t\t Property Tax \r\n\t\t\t Top Dog of Chester \r\n\t\t\t Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector\t\t \r\nSign up for email notifications from our office for important updates. \nThe Town Clerk/Tax Collector's Office is a combined office run by an elected Town Clerk/Tax Collector and an appointed Deputy Town Clerk/Tax Collector. The responsibilities for this office are as follows: \nAdministration of elections and oaths of office. \nAccept  voter registration  form requests. \nProcesses  dog licenses . \nMaintains  vital records . \nIssues marriage/civil union licenses. \nProcesses Department of Environmental Services wetlands applications. \nCustodian of all Town records. \nServes as a Municipal Agent for the State, issuing  vehicle registrations ,  boat registrations , title applications, plates, and decals. \nCollects  property taxes , as well as timber tax, current use change tax, and excavation tax as directed by the Selectboard through tax warrants. \nPlease explore our webpage for more information on the topics listed above. If you have any questions please reach out either by phone or email. \nGeneral Email Address:  townclerk@chesternh.org \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tJustine Celentano\r\nTown Clerk/Tax Collector \r\nEmail Justine Celentano  \r\nPhone:  603-887-3636 Ext. 108 \r\n\t\t\t\t\tMary Young\r\nDeputy Town Clerk \r\nEmail Mary Young  \r\nPhone:  603-887-3636 Ext. 118 \r\n\t\t\t\t\tMelanie Parker\r\nAssistant Town Clerk \r\nEmail Melanie Parker  \r\nTown Clerk/Tax Collector \r\nGeneral Email \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n\t\t\t\t\t 84 Chester Street \n\t\t\t\t\t Chester  ,  NH   03036 \r\nFax: 603-887-8811 \r\nHours of Operation: \nCounter Hours \nMonday and Wednesday: 8 am to 2 pm \nTue and Thu: 10 am to 6 pm \nFriday: Counter Closed \r\nNews Flash \r\n\t November 3, 2026 State General Election - Sample Ballot  \r\n\t\t\t\t Read on... \r\n\t\t View All News \r\n/CivicAlerts.aspx \r\n\t\t\t Forms & Applications \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments  \r\n\t\t\t Minutes & Agendas \r\n\t\t\t Property Assessments \r\n\t\t\t Contacts Directory \r\n\t\t\t Video Recordings \r\nTown of Chester \r\n84 Chester Street \r\nChester, New Hampshire 03036 \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
